  m_text: '-=Card Layout=-

    Hey lad! Left number is health. If you lose all this,
    you die!

    Right number is stamina. If you run out of this, you can''t use
    skills!

    Increase your Mastery Rank to increase these and gain more powerful
    skills!

    You can increase your damage output with Weapons, and your health
    with Gear!

    Some Artifacts may even increase your Stamina!'
